Added an "Add device" modal on the topology view to include existing devices or create new ones from the diagram.
Added optional cable creation when adding a device via the topology modal.
Added a `topology-data` API endpoint to refresh the topology graph without a full page reload.
Added `topology-mutation` API endpoints (`quick-device`, `quick-cable`) for creating devices and cables from the topology UI.
Added `topology_include` query parameter support to merge additional devices into the filtered topology queryset.
